      "title": "eval over the expr query parameter",
      "description": "The /calc handler passes req.query.expr straight to eval. The added suppression comment hides this from the scanner rather than fixing it. Anyone who can reach /calc runs arbitrary JavaScript in the server process, including file and network access. Parse the expression with a restricted arithmetic evaluator such as expr-eval. Otherwise reject anything but digits and operators and compute it without eval.",
